{"ID":"20240220161532-t2tp85q","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220161532-t2tp85q","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220161532-t2tp85q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312165805-w7y1dkz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312165457-4l1mtmc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:5200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312170203-z4bpx6r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:46,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:46\u0026#125;","title":"【大承气汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312170203"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312165805-w7y1dkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-w7y1dkz","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百二十四条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-kllezcp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-kllezcp","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明病」，脉迟，虽汗出，不恶寒，其身必重，短气，腹满而喘，有潮热者，此外欲解，可攻里也。手足濈然而汗出者，此大便已鞕也，「大承气汤」主之。若汗多，微发热恶寒者，外未解也，其热不潮，未可与「大承气汤」。若腹大满不通者，可与「小承气汤」，微和胃气，勿令大泄下。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-9sitxly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-9sitxly","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“「阳明病」，脉迟，虽汗出，不恶寒，其身必重，短气，腹满而喘，有潮热者，此外欲解，可攻里也。”意思是说，一定要等外解掉了，再去攻里，这个是外证要解掉了，本来是恶寒现在不恶寒了，汗出了，外症还没有完全去的时候，会有身重的现象，但是他已经在出汗了，脉缓下来了，代表他自己会恢复的状态。有潮热是阳明症，前面告诉诸位太阳证要去掉了，阳明证要出来了，这个时机就可以攻里。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果手脚汗出，这个潮热，知道大便已经硬掉了，「大承气汤」"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。若腹大满不通者，可与「小承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-ik7ziqz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-ik7ziqz","updated":"20240312165805"}},{"ID":"20240312165805-xrlb2y3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-xrlb2y3","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在介绍这一段的时候，我从金匮抓几个方子来，就会比较完整，整个消化系统你从此就不会犯错了，我现在讲的是实，没有讲热，热就是发炎，你不要胃炎，肠胃炎也拿来，不行的，不能乱攻。这是实症。在金匮里面有个处方，叫大黄甘草汤，这个使用时机是，在胃里常常会有二斗，在灵枢第三十一篇，肠胃篇里说，吃饱是下去的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胃里面是三斗二升"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，胃底下常常会有二斗，胃下方这个食物可以等七天，但是如果这个食物坏死掉了，吃到不干净食物，怎么清除它，就是大黄甘草汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你怎么知道是坏死的食物？朝食暮吐"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，早上吃进去，黄昏吐出来，就代表食物在胃里面并没有消化掉。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"经方有两个地方朝食暮吐，一个是虚症，胃虚的时候，朝食暮吐，吴茱萸汤症，胃寒的时候会用到"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这是实症，胃家实症，阳明证第一方应该是大黄甘草汤，朝食暮吐，舌苔一直是黄的，胃恶心，所以吃坏食物的时候，经方开出来的时候，就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄甘草汤，两味药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而已。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-3hplz6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-3hplz6m","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二个才是到十二指肠这边，这个才是进入到调胃承气，调胃承气就是吐，吐不出来，幽门挡到了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"梗到中膈的位置"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，调胃承气出现的时候，在下脘建里水分的地方一定有压痛，梗到这边，心里很难过，知道里面有东西梗到，有实的时候持续二十四小时，如果是虚的话，他就会有时候很好，有时候不好，实症梗到不管白天晚上，一直都不舒服。你问病人也问出来，你看他舌苔是黄的干的，你问他，胃痛，肚子痛是断续的痛还是持续的痛，持续的痛，结实了，因为他舌苔很黄，你摸他的脉，结实的脉很强硬。这个时候就是调胃承气。调胃承气有炙甘草，大黄，芒硝。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-uuccqal","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-uuccqal","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果到了小肠，小肠堵到，实发生在小肠里面，你怎么知道是发生在小肠里面？张仲景这里说，腹大满不通者，可与小承气汤。小承气汤是解阳明的燥矢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大便堵在小肠里面，病人有个主要的症状，就是排气"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你问他便秘实不实，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"便秘肚子胀满，一直不断的放屁，因为大肠没有堵到，大肠里面是空的，堵到小肠里面，大肠空的很多气在里面，他就不断的放屁"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个屁是从大肠出来的。不断放屁，脉很实，舌苔很黄，又是持续的痛，你压肚子，很痛拒按，就是小承气汤。小承气汤里又大黄，厚朴，枳实。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-grtrx8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-grtrx8m","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 第四个，如果是堵在大肠里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-q1bkuz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-q1bkuz4","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5——8"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-q4qiie8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-q4qiie8","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也是腹满，没有大便，堵在大肠里面是用大承气汤。大承气汤又四味药，大黄、芒硝、厚朴、枳实。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如何判断是堵在大肠里面，问病人便秘多久？七天没有大便，小便是黄的，任何的阳明燥实，小便一定是黄色的，因为燥热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，小便很黄，屁也不放一个，这个就是大承气汤症了。因为他大便统统堵到干掉了，根本连气都排不出去了，这是大承气汤症。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-ex6nrqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-ex6nrqf","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【经方有几个地方，一个是没有放屁，屁没有了，还有如果排出来大便是像鞭子一样，原因是你的大肠有很多干燥的大便在周围，只有中间可以通过，排出来像一根长鞭一样，便如鞭，也是大承气汤症。还有一种，大便很大一个，只有旁边有一个小缝，只有水可以通过，糟粕没办法通过，这个时候，病人一天十几次下痢，你一摸肚子是硬的，你问小便是什么颜色，深黄色的，肚子拒按又非常硬，这个下痢是因为便秘引起的下痢。（堵在）大肠的时候，你在大肠的募穴"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"天枢穴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，可以找到压痛点，小肠的话是小肠的募穴"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"关元穴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，可以找到压痛点。所以当排气都没有了，完全堵到，大承气。大便长长一条，也是用大承气。下痢不止也是用大承气。这是几个大承气汤。】"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-2kxv0j4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-2kxv0j4","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大便是梗到阑尾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"了，你怎么知道他梗在这个地方？急性盲肠炎发的时候，因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"盲肠刚好足阳明胃经经过这个地方，有盲肠炎出现脚会弓起来，右脚弓起来会比较舒服"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以他来看你的时候，右脚是弓到的。他右脚弓起来，肚子痛会减缓，缓冲一下，你压他足三里下一寸，阑尾穴，阑尾穴压到，他有压痛，再加上他脚弓起来比较舒服，我们就很肯定他是盲肠炎。这个时候用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄牡丹皮汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。经方拿到手上，不要担心不要怕，一定要有信心。你说，老师西医说肠破裂化脓就死人了，很危险，还是给西医开刀。不要，盲肠还是有用的，介绍金匮会讲，虽然小小一段盲肠，还是很管用的。大黄牡丹皮汤专门清这个阑尾发炎的地方。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阑尾发炎大部分痛在孕妇"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有的还痛在左边，脚还是弓到，脚弓到是一样的。大黄牡丹皮汤重用大黄，一剂下去全部清出来了。“老师，如果太慢了？嘭，破掉了，我怎么知道，他破掉了？”很简单，原来他肿胀堵到里面，不断的痛，不断的加强，瞬间他痛去掉了，不痛了，你摸他这个地方，非常的烫，其他都是冰的，你知道他破裂了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"破裂转腹膜炎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你如果给西医治疗，不断的用抗生素。中医这个就不用大黄了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用当归赤豆散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就当归跟赤小豆两味药，你用当归赤豆散的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"赤小豆一定要发芽"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以我们平常把赤小豆发一些牙放到那边冷藏，预备一些。发芽的赤小豆我随时准备着。只要他发芽发的跟豆芽一样，就给他冷冻那边。当归赤小豆，赤小豆一定要发芽的。当归赤豆散不单单用到肠子破裂，胆如果胆结石堵到，里面胆囊破裂的时候一样的症状，本来是剧痛，瞬间痛去掉了。破裂以后腹膜会把它包住，他不会散乱，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么赤小豆发牙才会好，取他的药性，本来是一根，破裂以后，腹膜把它包住是这个形状，赤小豆发芽后一根一根可以伸到很深的地方去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。当归赤小豆就两味药，不用煮，当归跟赤小豆打在一起，粘哒哒的就吃下去，跟生菜沙拉，效果非常好，吃下去他就可以动，原来不能动，他躺到那不动就不痛，一动就痛，因为腹膜炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-a2gbv4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-a2gbv4h","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有一个情形，妈妈回家，儿子躲到哪吓她，有的人是发奔豚，有的不是，大便梗到这边，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大肠这边有一个血管，直接络到肝脏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一紧张，干燥的大便顶到血管这边来，当干燥大便顶到（肝脏）这边，有一个特殊的症状会出现，叫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肠子中间有水气"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。病人便秘，这个地方痛，你压他肚子，一压咕噜咕噜水声很多，不是大承气，也不是小承气，这是受惊吓发的，用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"己椒苈黄丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，防己、椒目、葶苈子、大黄，做成丸剂，外面三钱的芒硝在汤里面，丸剂吞下去，芒硝汤冲下去，把这个大便打掉。一打掉整个大便大下。但是这个一定要用丸剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-fxszxt3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-fxszxt3","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当你堵在大肠里面，兼有恶心的时候，就是大柴胡汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，阳明症不会有恶心。大柴胡汤会用大黄，什么时候会柴胡汤加芒硝，就是屁都不放一个，就要加芒硝，这个知道燥矢的大便梗到大肠里面了，梗到直肠那边了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-l8adbjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-l8adbjb","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有一种情况也是用丸剂，他跟小承气互为表里，小肠堵到的时候，小肠津液没有了，我们用小承气，还有一种是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾约"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻子仁丸症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，麻子仁丸症是小肠堵到，小肠比较小，一节一节，大便堵到排出一粒一粒的，麻子仁丸症大便像羊便一颗颗排出来，这就是麻子仁丸症。你用麻子仁汤不行，必须要用麻子仁丸，丸剂下去，这个能够增润津液，大便排出就正常了。中医光是一个便秘肠胃就分这么多处方，实症，燥矢的话就是这样子，全部是用大黄。这样就不会辩证错误。至于剂量多少，后面会介绍。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-zdo9pby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-zdo9pby","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果你很了解这个病，你把病挡在这个肠子里面，病在阳明就走掉了，病就不会传。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-e30n7nd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-e30n7nd","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"还有一种不是用大黄，堵在盲肠这个地方，大肠头这边"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个病人陈述，大肠盲肠这边，很多食物堵在这边，压这里会痛，这一块地方出现问题就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"薏苡附子败酱散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个是在金匮里面。病人右下腹痛，不是很强的痛，隐隐作痛，也是拒按，你问他用不用脚弓到比较舒服，他不用，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"薏苡附子败酱散专门清大肠头这一块的东西"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这一块破裂堵到的时候，手上左手的生命线有一个开心果那么大的紫斑。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-oy283cx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-oy283cx","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只要是实症，都是持续的痛，不会断续的痛实症出现的时候，病人是拒按。实症出现病人会比较阳亢，讲话声音比较大，比较烦躁焦虑，睡不好。阴证出现的时候，比较缓慢，沉静。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-v9pou7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-v9pou7f","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小承气没有芒硝，调胃承气和大承气有用芒硝，大黄甘草汤也没有芒硝。攻下的药最强的就是大承气汤。芒硝不单单是攻坚硬的大便，芒硝攻肿块，积聚，癌症肿瘤都可以攻。炎症脓痒化脓积水统统可以使用芒硝。使用芒硝跟大黄的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"芒硝都不煮很久"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，煮芒硝成盐巴了，完全没有攻下的力量。中药生用的时候比较强。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-vr51qba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-vr51qba","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"调胃承气汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-yxdb0nr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-yxdb0nr","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄四两去皮，清酒洗。甘草二两炙，芒硝半斤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-lmqsifh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-lmqsifh","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水三升，煮取一升，去滓，纳芒硝，更上火微煮令沸，少少温服之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-qxeev7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-qxeev7c","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大黄四钱，用清酒洗，你不要真的酒洗，意思是泡一下酒就可以了。大黄酒洗过后药性比较缓，甘草两钱，芒硝一般两钱。煮的时候，先煮甘草，大黄，最后再放芒硝，稍微煮一下让芒硝能化 掉。单味大黄非常好用，没事眼白忽然血出来，或者没事流鼻血，上焦比较热的时候，用大黄泡茶，很快就消掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-tvxwoxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-tvxwoxg","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"小承气汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-akoj952","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-akoj952","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄四两酒洗。厚朴二两炙去皮。枳实三枚大者，炙。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-2cm6vah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-2cm6vah","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水四升，煮取一升二合，去滓，分温二服，当更衣；不尔者，尽饮之；若更衣者，勿服之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-5ljkx4i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-5ljkx4i","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大黄四钱。厚朴两钱。枳实三钱两钱都可以，枳实就是橘子，小橘子，淮河以北产的橘子叫枳实，淮河以南叫橘子，枳实小小的像金桔一样。厚朴是取树的皮，本来厚朴是生的，炙过干掉，二两比较轻。主力还是大黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-y0ytbh5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-y0ytbh5","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我介绍的阳明实症里面用的大黄，其他地方我们也会用到大黄，因为不在这个篇里面，就不讲了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-yec0085","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-yec0085","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在主要讲阳明热实，肠胃的燥实为主，才会有一系列肠胃从胃到肛门口大便怎么出去。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165805-ikt2u08","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165805-ikt2u08","updated":"20240312165805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床上很多地方在使用大承气汤。我们也曾经用过梅毒，病人来的时候，西医讲的梅毒，可他陈述出来七天不大便了，屁也不放一个，小便很黄，大承气攻下去，梅毒也好了。所以我常跟诸位说，要离，离卦，中间是虚的，心里面要不着相，不要被病名绑住。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170202-wjs8h0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170202-wjs8h0q"}},{"ID":"20240312170203-d5soez3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170203-d5soez3","updated":"20240312170203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百二十五条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170203-6ynm3ec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170203-6ynm3ec","updated":"20240312170203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明病」，潮热、大便已鞕者，可与「大承气汤」；不鞕者，不可与之。若不大便六七日，恐有燥屎，欲知之法，少与「小承气汤」，汤入腹中，转矢气者，此有燥屎，乃可攻之，若不转矢气者，此但初头鞕，后必溏，不可攻之，攻之必胀满，不能食也，欲饮水者，与水则哕。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170203-uq473yu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170203-uq473yu","updated":"20240312170203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「阳明病」，潮热，潮热就是一阵一阵的热，阳明病潮热一定在黄昏的时候。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明证有两个，一个时候腑实，一个是经热。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"承气汤症就是腑实，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"腑就是胃胆大肠小肠膀胱此类，经热就是在阳明经上的燥热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"经热是白虎汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。阳明讲的就是白虎和承气。承气会用到大黄和芒硝，白虎汤会用到石膏。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170203-7w4ropo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170203-7w4ropo","updated":"20240312170203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"潮热的时候病人有壮热，壮热就是发高烧，你只有两剂。一个是大便的燥矢造成的高热，还有一个是大便很通畅，经热也会有壮热。所以你只要确定他有没有大便，如果实在不知道看小便。经热的话小便是白的，腑热大便燥结在那边，小便是黄的。承气汤症小便是很深黄的。或者他一直在放屁，小承气汤。你只要确定他是承气汤症，快下，一剂就够了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170203-3gcnex2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170203-3gcnex2","updated":"20240312170203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“大便已鞕者，可与「大承气汤」；不鞕者，不可与之。”你确定他是大承气汤症，你只有大承气唯一处方，不要再去考虑其他了，大承气汤完全不放屁。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170203-ey92kmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170203-ey92kmi","updated":"20240312170203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“若不大便六七日，恐有燥屎，欲知之法，少与「小承气汤」，汤入腹中，转矢气（放屁）者，此有燥屎，乃可攻之，若不转矢气（放屁）者，此但初头鞕，后必溏，不可攻之，攻之必胀满，”这里告诉你，你如果开的不是大承气，开的是小承气，大便没出来，一直在放屁，你知道错了，大承气汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真正临床你只要问他有没有屁，没屁就是大承气讲完了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明燥热一定是舌头很黄，严重的话很黑，而且很干"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。黑有两种，一种舌苔，很寒，寒到极寒的时候舌苔也是黑色的，但是这个黑有润泽有津液。大承气汤那个黑根本就是干掉了，一摸脉脉跳的很大很数，再一摸额头，全身发烫的，眼睛都往上翻的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170203-4ulrpwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170203-4ulrpwl","updated":"20240312170203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ‘若不转矢气者，此但初头鞕，后必溏，不可攻之，攻之必胀满，不能食也，欲饮水者，与水则哕。’这个症状，前面是硬的后面是溏，代笔这个人肚子里面是寒湿的，大承气汤有大黄芒硝都是寒凉的药，本来已经溏了，溏就是有寒湿在里面，寒凉药再下去会加重，所以攻之胀满，不能吃东西了，欲饮水者，与水则哕。他想喝水，胃里面太冷了，喝水下去就打嗝。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"严重的话可以用茯苓四逆汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果攻下去他只是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"气很多，肚子胀满，排气很多，用厚朴生姜半夏人参甘草汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果是人体虚掉了以后，人非常虚，或者被你攻下，你也可以用理中汤。甚至他说胃口没了，吃东西都不能吃了，小建中汤也可以，小建中汤里面重用白芍。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170203-z4bpx6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170203-z4bpx6r","updated":"20240312170203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"打嗝很严重，但是你不能看到打嗝就不治了。中医经常说，男怕脚肿，女怕头肿。不能说很危险不治了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165806-yf3sq2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165806-yf3sq2e"}},{"ID":"20240312165705-di8rn3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165705-di8rn3c","updated":"20240312165705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百二十九条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165705-21fxayr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165705-21fxayr","updated":"20240312165705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」，若吐，若下后，不解，不大便五六日，日晡所发潮热，不恶寒，独语如见鬼状；若剧者，发则不识人，循衣摸床，惕而不安，微喘，直视；脉弦者生，濇者死。微者，但发热，谵语者，「大承气汤」主之，若一服利，止后服。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165705-9r8zfe9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165705-9r8zfe9","updated":"20240312165705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「伤寒」就是麻黄汤症，表实，而且寒，恶寒怕冷，全身痛。应该发表就好了。若吐，若下后，不解，不大便五六日，日晡所发潮热，不恶寒，代表表症没了，即使你是不对症，应该用汗法，结果你是用吐法下法，病还是会入里，因为你误治了，不大便五六天，失治以后传到里面去了，这个不恶寒，因为阳明无寒症。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165705-a0w92rr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165705-a0w92rr","updated":"20240312165705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"独语如见鬼状；若剧者，发则不识人，循衣摸床，循着衣服沿着床旁边走，惕而不安，遇到这种知道是实症。微喘，直视；脉弦者生，濇者死。就是津液伤到了，阴虚掉了，用承气汤，可以用些补阳滋阴的药，肉苁蓉是很好补肾阳的药，肉苁蓉有仁在里面，又可以滋阴。再加些人参都可以。微者，但发热，谵语者，「大承气汤」主之，若一服利，止后服。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"意思是大承气汤症，大便一通出来，可以停掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就可以停止后续的服用了。但是这个讲的是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"汤剂。你如果用的是粉剂，出不来的。应急的时候非要用汤剂"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165705-o62xni6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165705-o62xni6","updated":"20240312165705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"怎么判断好了？大肠、小肠里面没有东西时，小便出来是淡白色的，如果小便还是黄色的，继续吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165705-vn3fwnm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165705-vn3fwnm","updated":"20240312165705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"承气汤的时候，芒硝除了把大便燥矢打碎，最主要攻坚，包括肿瘤大肠癌，肿块或者是痰水梗在里面，大陷胸汤痰水梗在里面很硬很强，里面有芒硝。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170127-1qfdez0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170127-1qfdez0"}},{"ID":"20240312170127-b7d8cg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170127-b7d8cg9","updated":"20240312170127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百三十二、二百三十三条放在一起。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170127-5rxy3at","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170127-5rxy3at","updated":"20240312170127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明病」，谵语，有潮热，反不能食者，宜「大承气汤」下之，胃中必有燥屎五六枚也；若能食者，但鞕耳，宜「小承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170127-xehp49w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170127-xehp49w","updated":"20240312170127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个条辨是用能吃和不能吃决定是给大承气还是小承气。这样子也可以作为诊断依据。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170127-62f7dh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170127-62f7dh6","updated":"20240312170127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不能吃东西大承气，肠胃堵到了，干燥大便往回逆，不想吃东西。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170127-jykkw5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170127-jykkw5u","updated":"20240312170127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有胃口，小承气，没胃口，大承气，因为大承气的症状比小承气严重很多。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170114-m0dfovo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170114-m0dfovo"}},{"ID":"20240312170114-du4vigg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170114-du4vigg","updated":"20240312170114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百三十五条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170114-aouhxt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170114-aouhxt7","updated":"20240312170114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：汗出，此为风也，谵语者，以有燥矢在胃中；此表虚里实故也，须下之，下之则愈，宜「大承气汤」。过经乃可下之，下之若早，语言必乱。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170114-b5m1332","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170114-b5m1332","updated":"20240312170114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（在 6——2 集最后补讲）汗出，有流汗就是风。谵语者，以有燥矢在胃中，这个胃就是肠子里面，里实。“过经乃可下之”什么叫过经，就是从太阳到少阳到阳明就是过经，过经就是纯阳明症出现才可以下。有少阳症出现要先解少阳，有太阳症先解太阳。解完太阳少阳的时候，这个时候叫过经。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"单纯的阳明症再去攻下"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果下太早，攻下他本来就已经津伤了，一攻下表邪又跑到里面来，里面大便被攻掉了，里面是虚的，表邪跑到里面来，也会造成"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"言语必乱讲话不是很正常。跟谵语不太一样"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165706-v1ja4i4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165706-v1ja4i4"}},{"ID":"20240312165641-9b1r85q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165641-9b1r85q","updated":"20240312165641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":" 第二百三十八条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165641-j3ewgf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165641-j3ewgf5","updated":"20240312165641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「二阳并病」，「太阳证」罢，但发潮热，手足漀漀汗出，大便难而谵语者，下之则愈，宜「大承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165641-m1itzb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165641-m1itzb6","updated":"20240312165641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可能太阳少阳，或者少阳阳明，太阳阳明。「太阳证」罢，因为二阳有一个太阳，太阳症没了，表症没了。手脚汗出很多的时候，实症，里面确定是阳明燥矢造成的手脚汗多，这个时候可以开大承气汤。如果病人手脚汗多，但他不是承气汤症，是里虚的时候，你可以开桂枝汤，有汗，太阳在表，可以加一些龙骨牡蛎，收敛一下他，让阳潜下去。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170056-ds7aehr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170056-ds7aehr"}},{"ID":"20240312170056-kipcjny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170056-kipcjny","updated":"20240312170056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百五十三条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170056-mxldj7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170056-mxldj7d","updated":"20240312170056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明病」，下之，心中懊憹而烦，胃中有燥矢者，可攻。腹微满，初头硬，后必溏，不可攻之。若有燥矢者，宜「大承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170056-srb0t2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170056-srb0t2x","updated":"20240312170056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“心中懊憹而烦”，心中是指胃，胃里很烦恼，难过。胃中有燥矢的，可以攻。如果攻完腹是微满的或者说攻之前是微满的，大便刚开始比较硬，之后会变溏，这种情况不能再去攻它了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170056-bdzptda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170056-bdzptda","updated":"20240312170056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大承气攻后，当你的阳明症没了，比如烦躁，舌苔黄，小便深黄等，承气汤攻出来后，他感觉好舒服啊！还要不要继续吃？这个要不要继续吃看小便颜色，小便颜色淡黄，可以停掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170056-bu2sdw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170056-bu2sdw2","updated":"20240312170056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"承气汤症或者白虎汤证的时候晚上会很烦躁，燥热，喜欢喝冷水，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"手即使是温的，一摸头头会很烫很热，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脉都是洪大的，当你攻出来以后脉会小下去。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165642-c3jdy7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165642-c3jdy7d"}},{"ID":"20240312165623-f73b7ai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165623-f73b7ai","updated":"20240312165623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百五十五条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165623-3wjtzvh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165623-3wjtzvh","updated":"20240312165623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：病人烦热，汗出则解，又如疟状，日晡所发热者，属「阳明」也；脉实者，宜下之；脉浮虚者，宜发汗。下之与「大承气汤」。发汗宜「桂枝汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165623-6gqev2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165623-6gqev2k","updated":"20240312165623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“病人烦热”这个烦热不见的情绪，而是病人觉得很燥热，烦躁，流汗出来就觉得很舒服。“又如疟状，日晡所发热者，”看到忽冷忽热像疟，但是只要是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄昏看到发热，就已经到了阳明了就可以承气，白虎来挑。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312165623-19weswq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165623-19weswq","updated":"20240312165623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“脉浮虚者，宜发汗。”脉虚浮代表病还在表。有表症的时候，绝对忌下。因为有热，所以绝对不好用麻黄汤开表。麻黄汤一开表，不是大承气汤就被你变成大承气汤，因为你不需要麻黄汤，结果你麻黄汤下去，发汗太过了。发汗的时候你用桂枝汤，实际上你真正发汗的时候，你用桂枝汤一两三两上去的，你用再多也不会变阳明症，因为后面有生姜甘草大枣。所以桂枝汤是经方家调和阴阳最好的方子。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170038-zjekwi9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170038-zjekwi9"}},{"ID":"20240312170038-rp2ntkr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170038-rp2ntkr","updated":"20240312170038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百五十六条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170038-4wh9lfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170038-4wh9lfp","updated":"20240312170038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：大下后，六七日不便，烦不解，腹满者，此有燥矢也，所以然者，又有宿食故也，宜「大承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170038-wvhpe03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170038-wvhpe03","updated":"20240312170038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"攻下之后，可能还有宿便没有完全干净，肚子还是很胀满，其实可以问病人，你觉得干净没有，病人最清楚。没有完全攻出来，再攻。有宿便赶快攻，以我的看法，至少百分之八十的癌症跟便秘都有关系。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165623-2r6x187","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165623-2r6x187"}},{"ID":"20240312165610-ws0qv5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165610-ws0qv5b","updated":"20240312165610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百五十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165610-w5o9eg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165610-w5o9eg7","updated":"20240312165610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：病人小便不利，大便乍难乍易，时有微热，喘冒不得卧者，有燥屎也，宜「大承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165610-000oz4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165610-000oz4d","updated":"20240312165610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便如果太干的时候，下焦太热的时候，小便都变得很短赤（又黄又少），这个不利不是没有，而是变得很短，赤，颜色很深。这都是大承气汤症。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165610-icr5grp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165610-icr5grp","updated":"20240312165610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在讲阳明的燥矢，有的时候，他有便秘，但是跟阳明症没有关系，后面会介绍到。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165611-46wx3v6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165611-46wx3v6"}},{"ID":"20240312165547-3taytxm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165547-3taytxm","updated":"20240312165547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百六十六条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165547-3ifqqtx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165547-3ifqqtx","updated":"20240312165547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：得病二三日，脉弱，无「太阳柴胡证」，烦躁，心下鞭，至四五日，虽能食，以「小承气汤」少少与微和之，令小安。至五六日，舆「小承气汤」一升。若不大便，小便少者。虽不能食，但初头鞕，后必溏，未定成鞕，攻之必溏。须小便利，矢定鞕，乃可攻之，宜「大承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165547-sjrj7jp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165547-sjrj7jp","updated":"20240312165547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无「太阳柴胡证」，表症，怕风恶寒，体重节痛，有汗、发烧项强都没有，柴胡的往来寒热、胸胁苦满、恶心都没有。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165547-5iqqmvt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165547-5iqqmvt","updated":"20240312165547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腹中湿很盛的时候，攻下的时候，张仲景的意思是要等，怎么知道湿很盛？第一个腹满，第二个，大便是溏泻，比较软比较稀。张仲景意思是，等他湿小便排利出来，等他大便完全称为干燥的时候，乃可攻。用大承气汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165547-wnxpsd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165547-wnxpsd5","updated":"20240312165547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们是否真的需要等它呢？不需要等。我们有很多处方可以治疗他，比如说我们知道他有湿，加些去湿的药让他小便利出来，可以用五苓散，五苓散可以利湿，但是病人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一定要有小便不利，口渴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的现象，用五苓散。五苓散配合承气汤一起就可以使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165547-tcdjg6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165547-tcdjg6z","updated":"20240312165547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伤寒论的条辨是很死的，临床上用的时候是很活。你只要记得，大承气汤是用在纯燥矢的时候，完全没有其他的副症在里面，如过有其他的症状，里面有湿，大便还没有结硬，还有溏的时候，光是大承气下，张仲景不赞成，因为还没有纯阳明症，那你要用利湿的方法，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"去湿的方法就是利小便，除非湿在关节的时候，用汗解来去湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，否则的话都是利小便。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165547-cma58nj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165547-cma58nj","updated":"20240312165547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中医治病汗吐下法。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"下法分两个"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"攻大便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"攻小便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳症的时候，攻大便是最快的。当阴证才会去利小便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以不管是实脾饮，分消汤，或者是补气建中汤，都是去利湿，利小便出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以在阴证一般都会去利小便，很少去利大便。阳症的时候利大便。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"利小便的力量没有利大便那么好，所以能够把病阻止在阳明证的时候，通大便的药会比利小便的药来的快，几乎无所不通"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。小便就不见的利出来了，因为他是阴证。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165555-jmf8r2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165555-jmf8r2c"}},{"ID":"20240312165555-fdzt29v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165555-fdzt29v","updated":"20240312165555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百六十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165555-rs4jhrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165555-rs4jhrt","updated":"20240312165555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」六七日，目中不了了，睛不和，无表里证，大便难，身微热者，此为实也，急下之，宜「大承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165555-gefzab0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165555-gefzab0","updated":"20240312165555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“目中不了了”眼睛看不清楚了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165555-55nx6k8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165555-55nx6k8","updated":"20240312165555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个告诉诸位阳明证燥矢的时候，沼气会往回逆。回逆的时候不单单是会捻衣摸床，发狂奔走，还有眼睛看不清楚。没有表里证，伤寒没有恶寒体痛，没有高热脉浮都没有，出现这个症状要考虑大便通不痛。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明的燥矢会影响到眼睛的视力。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312165547-35y7utc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165547-35y7utc"}},{"ID":"20240312165536-k1lpaie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165536-k1lpaie","updated":"20240312165536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百六十八条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165536-fbybfkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165536-fbybfkh","updated":"20240312165536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明病」，发热汗多者，急下之，宜「大承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165536-654kdgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165536-654kdgp","updated":"20240312165536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当有大承气汤症，大便堵在肠子里面的时候，会造成很多人很快热起来，流汗流很快，津液会丧失的很快，遇到这个要急下，赶快下。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"急下存阴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不能再考虑了，因为很热，干燥的大便，会把津液发散掉。等到津液伤到了，已经完全没有津液了，药都吞不下的时候就危险了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170015-ftrjmkf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170015-ftrjmkf"}},{"ID":"20240312170015-gcvs96s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170015-gcvs96s","updated":"20240312170015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百六十九条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170015-idxcsx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170015-idxcsx3","updated":"20240312170015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：发汗，不解，腹满痛者，急下之，宜「大承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170015-8pjdvt6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170015-8pjdvt6","updated":"20240312170015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“腹满痛者”有痛的现象，拒按，实症。我们要急下，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"急下存阴的时候，不会用到调胃承气小承气。快下的时候用大承气。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170004-jmn5x1b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170004-jmn5x1b"}},{"ID":"20240312170004-z9t9f5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170004-z9t9f5y","updated":"20240312170004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百七十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170004-ekni4oy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170004-ekni4oy","updated":"20240312170004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：腹满不减，减不足言，当下之，宜「大承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170004-omvnjl9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170004-omvnjl9","updated":"20240312170004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果腹满大便攻了，排出来还是肚子胀，宿便很多，当攻下，大承气汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165951-ov8bouh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165951-ov8bouh"}},{"ID":"20240312165951-lrrm5un","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165951-lrrm5un","updated":"20240312165951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百七十一条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165951-03rnksf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165951-03rnksf","updated":"20240312165951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明少阳合病」，必下利；其脉不负者，顺也；负者，失也；互相克贼，名为负也；脉滑而数者，有宿食也；当下之，宜「大承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165951-8fqlhwy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165951-8fqlhwy","updated":"20240312165951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"少阳脉弦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明脉大"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果摸到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脉是相符合的，阳明兼少阳症，摸到脉是浮的弦细，这个脉是顺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果脉和症不合，互相贼克"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是阳明和少阳在互相冲突了。病进入少阳有机会进入太阴少阴厥阴。如果进入阳明就不会再进了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165951-zttl8nc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165951-zttl8nc","updated":"20240312165951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果脉滑而数，这是里面燥矢结到了。赶快攻大承气汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165951-ikrued6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165951-ikrued6","updated":"20240312165951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床如果遇到阳明少阳并病的时候，有下痢，再摸他脉也有燥矢，肚子硬，拒按。胸胁又苦满，这个时候常常开柴胡承气，合在一起开。像大柴胡汤里面已经有枳实芍药大黄，如果再加厚朴就是大承气汤了。如果把炙甘草拿掉，标准的承气汤了。柴胡汤跟承气汤开在一起没关系。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165536-5g1l77t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165536-5g1l77t"}},{"ID":"20240312165522-ptbtqr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165522-ptbtqr5","updated":"20240312165522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百三十四条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165522-bzbfngw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165522-bzbfngw","updated":"20240312165522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「少阴病」，得之二三日，口燥咽干者，急下之，宜「大承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165522-wfjmta2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165522-wfjmta2","updated":"20240312165522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“口燥咽干者”照理少阴病不会有口燥咽干，这还是大承气汤症。如果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有阴证的时候，看到阳明证，这种都是很好，就是病回头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。阴症不要看到阴，看到阳症代表好。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165931-wy0a60g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165931-wy0a60g"}},{"ID":"20240312165931-vqvnizo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165931-vqvnizo","updated":"20240312165931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百三十五条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165931-2tbspk4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165931-2tbspk4","updated":"20240312165931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「少阴病」，自利清水，色纯青，心下必痛，口干燥者，急下之，宜「大承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165931-trh0zdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165931-trh0zdt","updated":"20240312165931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有一种燥矢宿便，是大便很大堵到，旁边只有一点点小缝隙，一般大便通不过去，只有水能通过去，结果拉出来的是水。病人说下痢，一天二三十次都是水排出来，你要小心哦，一种真的是寒利，一种根本是承气汤症。如果病人是承气汤症，你开成大黄附子细辛汤，没有用，如果是寒实你开成承气汤，也没有用。所以你压他肚子判断，一压很痛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"拒按，小便是深黄色"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个时候，病人的下痢是因为便秘。病人气色光鲜，舌头很黄，还在下痢，应该是便秘。真实少阴症的时候，大黄附子细辛汤，病人很安静，阳症的时候病人很闹。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165522-e8eenzh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165522-e8eenzh"}},{"ID":"20240312165511-3519tqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165511-3519tqv","updated":"20240312165511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百三十六条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165511-fkzb1ve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165511-fkzb1ve","updated":"20240312165511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「少阴病」，六七日腹胀不大便者，急下之，宜「大承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165511-23qrz9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165511-23qrz9z","updated":"20240312165511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果是少阴病，六七天不大便了，结果肚子很胀，一看他是大承气汤症，就用大承气汤攻，只要有症在就可以使用他。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165511-9q1w4j6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165511-9q1w4j6","updated":"20240312165511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果少阴症出现，他是腹胀，他并没有感觉到大便很难过，小便是淡白的，这个就不是大承气汤。是大黄附子细辛汤症。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165511-b5x67l0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165511-b5x67l0"}},{"ID":"20240312165457-zkugzbs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165457-zkugzbs","updated":"20240312165457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百九十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165457-l8kuk55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165457-l8kuk55","updated":"20240312165457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：下利，谵语者，有燥矢也，宜「大承气汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312165457-4l1mtmc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312165457-4l1mtmc","updated":"20240312165457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便干在里面造成的下痢，还是大承气汤。"}]}]}